<title>GERMANY: Victoria Holding to pay 28 pct '96 dividend.</title>
<headline>Victoria Holding to pay 28 pct '96 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend					28 pct vs 25 pct</p>
<p>    Earnings per share		  50.63 marks  vs 45.28</p>
<p>    Group net profit		   116 million marks vs 86 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Victoria Holding AG. The percentage rate for the dividend is compared to the nominal value of the shares.</p>
